Description: configuration tool for the AJAZZ AK820 Pro keyboard
 Native GNOME (GTK 4 / libadwaita) app and command line tool for the AJAZZ
 AK820 Pro keyboard over USB cable: lighting effects, screen image/GIF upload
 and clock sync. Includes a udev rule so the logged-in desktop user can talk
 to the keyboard without root.
 .
 Unofficial; not affiliated with AJAZZ. The protocol was worked out by
 observing the keyboard and its configuration software.
